<http://data.silknow.org/object/a1e95913-fd45-3afd-b6e3-fc66e5ef5f2a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woman’s petticoat of pink silk satin, lined with a undyed glazed worsted and wadded with a thin layer of wool.  It is quilted in running stitch with pink silk thread in a horizontal pattern of wide swags with bows and flowers around the hem and a diamond pattern of 1-½ inch (3.5 cm) squares, above.  The petticoat is made of 6 panels of silk, opening at the centre back with a pocket cut into the panel on the right side.\n\nThe petticoat was altered in the 19th century for fancy dress.  A pocket bag was sewn into the pocket opening and the waist tape and ties removed and replaced with a wide silk waistband with 2 hooks and eyes."@en , "Woman's petticoat, 1760-80, British; Pink silk satin, quilted with swags and diamond pattern, altered 1870-1900"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/299da838-3fae-3fa5-8d9f-3514bcd1189f> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Woman’s petticoat of pink silk satin, lined with a undyed glazed worsted and wadded with a thin layer of wool.  It is quilted in running stitch with pink silk thread in a horizontal pattern of wide swags with bows and flowers around the hem and a diamond pattern of 1-½ inch (3.5 cm) squares, above.  The petticoat is made of 6 panels of silk, opening at the centre back with a pocket cut into the panel on the right side.\n\nThe petticoat was altered in the 19th century for fancy dress.  A pocket bag was sewn into the pocket opening and the waist tape and ties removed and replaced with a wide silk waistband with 2 hooks and eyes."@en , "Woman's petticoat, 1760-80, British; Pink silk satin, quilted with swags and diamond pattern, altered 1870-1900"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/a1e95913-fd45-3afd-b6e3-fc66e5ef5f2a/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/a1e95913-fd45-3afd-b6e3-fc66e5ef5f2a/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/a1e95913-fd45-3afd-b6e3-fc66e5ef5f2a/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/a1e95913-fd45-3afd-b6e3-fc66e5ef5f2a/dimension/2> ;
